    "name": "skill-source-compiler",
    "description_yaml": "description: Compile structured skill source bundles into portable Agent Skills\n  folders. Use when authoring, normalizing, or regenerating complex multi-file\n  skills that need explicit active references, outcome-first instruction\n  structure, supporting docs, and portability rules.",
    "source_sha256": "5de6ebc50e4e336670b1e3660c0681f551386769f1cf578f2687af5274a7b938"
  },
  {
    "name": "code-reviewer",
    "description_yaml": "description: Perform read-only review of PRs, diffs, and local branch changes.\n  Use to find bugs or regressions, assess maintainability, tests, compatibility,\n  or lightweight intent alignment, and provide evidence-backed merge guidance\n  with stable scope, severity, and findings; pair with relevant domain skills.",
    "source_sha256": "f3d13999a5f06f06306ce4ad8e41ecb27b6c4a5b652175b427301d6d9e41ff29"
  },
  {
    "name": "documentation",
    "description_yaml": "description: Create, review, restructure, and rewrite source-grounded technical\n  documentation with Diataxis. Use for tutorials, how-to guides, reference,\n  explanations, docs architecture, and audits of user-need fit, factual support,\n  task completion, and maintainability.",
    "source_sha256": "f85810ef121bdb972509ce6d0fdccf9337f5fe3bac981a598218c5e6f0a23ef9"
  },
  {
    "name": "spec-conformance-reviewer",
    "description_yaml": "description: Review code against authoritative specs, contracts, ADRs, tickets,\n  PRDs, RFCs, migrations, and acceptance criteria. Build requirement-to-code\n  traceability, identify compliance gaps or ambiguities, and issue an\n  implementation-versus-spec verdict limited by source authority and evidence.",
    "source_sha256": "69725c20404fea0ac514af9a3c8651f505c519b5326ae7c76ea053235117778b"
  }
]
{
  "name": "skill-reviewer",
  "description": "Independently review agent skills for real capability, instruction quality, trigger boundaries, contracts, interop, parity, portability, and evidence integrity. Use for baseline, change, re-audit, or closure reviews; issue P1/P2/P3 findings and PASS, FAIL, BLOCKED, or PROVISIONAL without edits.",
  "interface": {
    "display_name": "Skill Reviewer",
    "short_description": "Independent reviews of skill capability",
    "default_prompt": "Use $skill-reviewer to independently review this skill package and issue an evidence-backed verdict."
  }
}
